    {
      "name": "Real-time Events (SSE)",
      "item": [
        {
          "id": "sse-001",
          "name": "Subscribe to Admin SSE Stream",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" },
              { "key": "Accept", "value": "text/event-stream" },
              { "key": "Cache-Control", "value": "no-cache" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/events",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "events"]
            },
            "description": "Opens a persistent Server-Sent Events (SSE) connection. The server streams events as they occur in the platform.\n\n**Authentication**: Valid admin JWT required.\n\n**Client usage (React admin portal)**:\n```js\nconst es = new EventSource(`${API_BASE}/api/v1/admin/events`, {\n  headers: { Authorization: `Bearer ${adminToken}` }\n});\n\nes.addEventListener('ticket:created', e => {\n  const ticket = JSON.parse(e.data);\n  // show toast / update badge count\n});\n\nes.addEventListener('verification:submitted', e => { ... });\nes.addEventListener('report:filed', e => { ... });\nes.addEventListener('consultation:completed', e => { ... });\nes.addEventListener('user:registered', e => { ... });\nes.addEventListener('review:flagged', e => { ... });\n\nes.onerror = () => es.close();\n```\n\n**Polling interval**: DB is polled every 5 seconds. Maximum latency before an event appears = 5 s.\n\n**Heartbeat**: Server sends a `: ping` SSE comment every 25 s to keep the connection alive through proxies."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sse-002",
          "name": "SSE Connection Status",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{adminToken}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/events/status",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "events", "status"]
            },
            "description": "Returns the number of admin SSE clients currently connected. Useful for monitoring / debugging.\n\n**Response**: `{ success: true, data: { connectedClients: 3 } }`"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sse-003",
          "name": "[EVENT SCHEMA] ticket:created",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/events", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "events"] },
            "description": "Fired when a user (customer or expert) submits a new support ticket.\n\n**SSE format**:\n```\nevent: ticket:created\ndata: {\"id\":\"uuid\",\"subject\":\"Cannot access history\",\"category\":\"consultation\",\"userId\":\"uuid\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-19T...\"}\n```\n\n**Admin action**: Navigate to Support Tickets module to view and respond."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sse-004",
          "name": "[EVENT SCHEMA] verification:submitted",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/events", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "events"] },
            "description": "Fired when an expert submits identity/credential verification documents.\n\n**SSE format**:\n```\nevent: verification:submitted\ndata: {\"id\":\"uuid\",\"expertId\":\"uuid\",\"expertName\":\"John Doe\",\"submittedAt\":\"2026-08-19T...\"}\n```\n\n**Admin action**: Navigate to Verifications module → approve or reject."
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sse-005",
          "name": "[EVENT SCHEMA] report:filed",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/v1/admin/events", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["api", "v1", "admin", "events"] },
            "description": "Fired when a customer files a complaint against an expert.\n\n**SSE format**:\n```\nevent: report:filed\ndata: {\"id\":\"uuid\",\"expertId\":\"uuid\",\"customerId\":\"uuid\",\"reason\":\"Inappropriate behaviour\",\"createdAt\":\"2026-08-19T...\"}\n```"
          }
        },
        {
