            "description": "Fired when a consultation session ends and billing is settled.\n\n**SSE format**:\n```\nevent: consultation:completed\ndata: {\"id\":\"uuid\",\"expertId\":\"uuid\",\"customerId\":\"uuid\",\"durationSeconds\":1800,\"billingStatus\":\"charged\",\"endedAt\":\"2026-08-19T...\"}\n```"
          }
        },
